# Sentinel of Lost Lore: "When this creature enters, choose one or more" (CR 700.2), each mode with its own target (CR 700.2c). Turn 1: Bot1 casts Bonecrusher Giant as Stomp, so
# its Giant sits in exile on an adventure. Turn 2: Bot2 does the same with its Giant and also bolts Bot1 (the Bolt is in Bot2's graveyard). Turn 3: Bot1 casts the Sentinel
# with the Lotus and chooses all three modes: its own Giant returns to its hand, Bot2's Giant goes on the bottom of Bot2's library (not to Bot1's), and Bot2's graveyard is exiled.
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Bonecrusher Giant
Black Lotus
Sentinel of Lost Lore
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Bonecrusher Giant
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

