? Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
? Exile = Bonecrusher Giant; Bonecrusher Giant
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Sentinel of Lost Lore.Cast
